    {
      "name": "fp8_act_quant",
      "qualname": "fp8_act_quant",
      "module": "_finegrained_fp8_cuda_5fe9dbb.utils",
      "kind": "function",
      "doc": "Quantize activations to FP8 with per-block dynamic scaling.\n\nSplits the last dimension of ``x`` into blocks of ``block_size`` elements,\ncomputes ``scale = max(|x_block|) / 448`` per block, and quantizes to\n``float8_e4m3fn``.\n\nArgs:\n    x: Input tensor in bf16/fp16/fp32. Last dimension must be divisible by\n        ``block_size`` and the tensor must be contiguous.\n    block_size: Number of elements per quantization block (default: 128).\n\nReturns:\n    A tuple ``(quantized, scales)`` where ``quantized`` has dtype\n    ``float8_e4m3fn`` with the same shape as ``x``, and ``scales`` has\n    shape ``(*x.shape[:-1], x.shape[-1] // block_size)`` in float32.",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": null,
            "annotation": "torch.Tensor"
          },
          {
            "name": "block_size",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": "128",
            "annotation": "int"
          }
        ],
        "return_annotation": "tuple[torch.Tensor, torch.Tensor]"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "matmul_2d",
      "qualname": "matmul_2d",
      "module": "_finegrained_fp8_cuda_5fe9dbb.matmul",
      "kind": "function",
      "doc": "Quantized matmul dispatcher (W8A8 FP8 or W4A8 FP4).\n\n``A`` is always raw bf16/fp16/fp32; quantization is fused into every path.\nWith ``activation_scale`` set, the kernel uses that per-tensor scalar\n(static quant); otherwise it computes its own scale from ``A`` (dynamic).\n\n``output_dtype`` defaults to ``A.dtype``.\n\nRoutes by weight dtype and ``block_size``:\n- MX weights — ``int8`` (packed E2M1) or ``float8_e4m3fn`` (E4M3) with UE8M0\n  group-32 ``Bs`` (shape ``[N, K//32]``) → ``mxfp_dynamic_matmul`` (``block_size``\n  ignored, ``activation_scale`` unsupported; scale granularity fixed at 32, autotuned).\n- ``block_size`` None or full ``[N, K]`` → ``w8a8_tensor_dynamic_fp8_matmul``.\n- otherwise → ``w8a8_block_dynamic_fp8_matmul`` (or its static variant when\n  ``activation_scale`` is given).",
      "signature": {
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "A",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": null,
            "annotation": "torch.Tensor"
          },
          {
            "name": "B",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": null,
            "annotation": "torch.Tensor"
          },
          {
            "name": "Bs",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": null,
            "annotation": "torch.Tensor"
          },
          {
            "name": "block_size",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": null,
            "annotation": "list[int] | None"
          },
          {
            "name": "output_dtype",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": "None",
            "annotation": "torch.dtype | None"
          },
          {
            "name": "activation_scale",
            "kind": "POSITIONAL_OR_KEYWORD",
            "default": "None",
            "annotation": "torch.Tensor | None"
          }
        ],
        "return_annotation": "torch.Tensor"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "matmul_batched",
      "qualname": "matmul_batched",
